      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been taking sertraline (zoloft) 50mg for a few months now for my anxiety. i just got a really bad cold and have this annoying dry cough that wont go away. is it okay if i take some of that daytime cold & flu liquid stuff with me? i think it has dextromethorphan in it, i just need to sleep tonight.",
